                                                "sense_id": "7bd45d72-de31-3ea4-bb0d-8158b129ddb8",
                                                "text": "[…] till a long-legged boy brought him out of his revery, by an offer to carry his “plunder,” in whatsoever direction he might desire to direct his steps."
